  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "特殊搜寻搞定啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72796B8A641C5BFB641E5B9A5566FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "特殊？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72796B8AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "搜寻？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "641C5BFBFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "异次元密阿雷不是还会继续出现吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F026B2151435BC6963F96F74E0D662F8FD84F1A7EE77EED51FA73B05417FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那里面应该也会有\n完全未知的异次元密阿雷！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A391CC97625E948BE54E5F4F1A6709000A5B8C5168672A77E576845F026B2151435BC6963F96F7FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用来发现那些未知的\n异次元密阿雷的系统……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n就是<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>特殊搜寻<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7528676553D173B090A34E9B672A77E57684000A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F776847CFB7EDF2026202600100001BE01000A5C31662F00100002FF00000672796B8A641C5BFB00100002FF000000FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然我说得好像是自己的功劳一样，\n但其实是阔星公司开发的啦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713662118BF45F97597D50CF662F81EA5DF17684529F52B34E006837FF0C000A4F4651765B9E662F9614661F516C53F85F0053D176845566300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有了这个特殊搜寻，\n就能找到通往未知异次元密阿雷的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n特殊异次元扭洞了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E868FD94E2A72796B8A641C5BFBFF0C000A5C3180FD627E5230901A5F80672A77E55F026B2151435BC6963F96F7768400100001BE00000A72796B8A5F026B215143626D6D1E4E86FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，现在还没有大功告成。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n还需要进行异次元调查才行！\n你去努力完成异次元课题吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C73B057288FD86CA167095927529F544A6210300200100001BE01000A8FD8970089818FDB884C5F026B2151438C0367E5624D884CFF01000A4F6053BB52AA529B5B8C62105F026B2151438BFE98985427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了让特殊搜寻大功告成，\n你去努力完成异次元课题吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868BA972796B8A641C5BFB5927529F544A6210FF0C000A4F6053BB52AA529B5B8C62105F026B2151438BFE98985427FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B82E64E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来你顺利地办好了\n乌羽先生拜托给你的事啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B67654F60987A52295730529E597D4E86000A4E4C7FBD5148751F62DC62587ED94F6076844E8B554A300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "劳驾你来一趟\n乌羽先生的房间吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52B39A7E4F6067654E008D9F000A4E4C7FBD5148751F7684623F95F45427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B82E65566FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好呐，我来把你收集的数据\n导入系统……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5450FF0C62116765628A4F60653696C676846570636E000A5BFC51657CFB7EDF2026202600100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "成了！\n特殊搜寻大功告成啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62104E86FF01000A72796B8A641C5BFB5927529F544A62105566FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为能搜寻特殊的异次元扭洞，\n所以叫特殊搜寻！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A80FD641C5BFB72796B8A76845F026B215143626D6D1EFF0C000A62404EE553EB72796B8A641C5BFBFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果需要启动\n特殊搜寻系统，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就请和我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C97008981542F52A8000A72796B8A641C5BFB7CFB7EDFFF0C00100001BE00000A5C318BF7548C62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "干得不错嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E725F974E0D9519561BFF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在只能靠特殊搜寻才能发现的\n异次元密阿雷中，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n存在特殊宝可梦的可能性很高！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572853EA80FD976072796B8A641C5BFB624D80FD53D173B07684000A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F74E2DFF0C00100001BE00000A5B58572872796B8A5B9D53EF68A6768453EF80FD60275F889AD8FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，要想使用特殊搜寻，\n每次都需要重新累积数据。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C898160F34F7F752872796B8A641C5BFBFF0C000A6BCF6B2190FD9700898191CD65B07D2F79EF6570636E300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然会有点辛苦，\n但对你来说，这都是小菜一碟吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71364F1A670970B98F9B82E6FF0C000A4F465BF94F6067658BF4FF0C8FD990FD662F5C0F83DC4E00789F5427FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使用特殊搜寻\n需要异次元调查点数。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F752872796B8A641C5BFB000A970089815F026B2151438C0367E570B96570300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "乌羽叫你去找他……\n前往锈蚀组的事务所吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4C7FBD53EB4F6053BB627E4ED620262026000A524D5F80950886807EC476844E8B52A162405427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    }
